  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 2101.09 Educational Outreach Program",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 2101.09 Educational Outreach Program. The owner shall:\n\n(a) Implement an on-going educational outreach initiative for its customers to promote water conservation; and\n\n(b) Submit the records of the water conservation outreach activities as specified in (a) above to the department with the report specified in Env-Wq 2101.27.\n\nSource. #8353, eff 5-14-05 (See Revision Note at part heading for Env-Wq 2101) (formerly Env-Ws 390.09); ss by #10480-A, eff 12-3-13; ss by #14004, eff 6-22-24 (formerly Env-Wq 2101.12)",
